.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="fdtd_2d_tmz and fdtd_2d_tmz_evolve integrate the same TMz-mode Maxwell curl equations as the other FDTD examples in this gallery, but already enforce Ez=0 on all four grid edges every step -- exactly a perfectly-conducting (PEC) cavity wall, no absorbing boundary needed. A rectangular PEC cavity of size L_x\times L_y supports discrete standing-wave modes">

